OL,3,ATrump welcomes Xi for state dinner as
OL,4,Atech bosses and other guests arrive at
OL,5,AWhite House
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump and First Lady Melania
OL,8,Fwelcome Xi Jinping and his wife Peng
OL,9,FLiyuan back to the White House, where
OL,10,Fthe leaders will deliver remarks and
OL,11,Fattend a state dinner - check out the
OL,12,Fmenu
OL,14,FWho has a seat at the table? Big tech
OL,15,Fbosses are on the list, including
OL,16,FTesla's Elon Musk, Apple's Tim Cook,
OL,17,FOpenAI's Sam Altman and Nvidia's Jensen
OL,18,FHuang - watch live above
